AgentCraft Server
https://github.com/ZogoratXV/Ai-Agent-Minecraft

This project is inspired by AgentCraft (https://github.com/blendi-remade/agentcraft):
its architecture (a foreman that owns all state and a Minecraft-side view over a local
WebSocket), its bridge protocol shape, task graph, decision queue, per-task git worktrees and
git-level push blocking. No source files were copied; modules that closely follow an AgentCraft
design say so in their header comment.

